            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "HL0xe",
              "name": "标签多选交付标题",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "确认添加 · 统一标签多选",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 22,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ySAYw",
              "name": "入口与范围",
              "fill": "$body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "存储、SSH、Redis 共用确认页标签组件。标签可选；多选后展示完整路径，可逐项移除。超宽时折叠为“+N”，完整选择在弹出面板中可见。",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "NkXTf",
              "name": "弹出与选择",
              "fill": "$body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "点击标签输入框打开弹出面板，优先向上展开，避开操作栏。可搜索名称与路径；复选当前标签，不自动勾选子标签。折叠和搜索不丢失选择。",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "AoD4X",
              "name": "确认与取消",
              "fill": "$body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "“确认选择”将本次选择写回向导；“取消”、关闭按钮、Esc 或点击外部放弃本次更改。清空后确认可以保存空选择。“确认添加”一次提交实例及已选标签。",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ClNMW",
              "name": "状态保留",
              "fill": "$body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "上一步再返回保留已确认标签。保存失败保留已选标签；保存中关闭面板并禁用编辑与重复提交。标签为空时仍可确认添加。",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "tXcsS",
              "name": "键盘与空态",
              "fill": "$body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Tab 切换焦点；Enter 打开面板；方向键浏览树，Space 勾选；Esc 取消并回到触发框。无标签提示“暂无可选标签”；无搜索结果提示“未找到匹配的标签”，保留已有选择。",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ocmvS",
              "name": "双语文案与资源",
              "fill": "$body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "标签（可选） / Tags (optional)\n选择标签 / Select tags\n搜索标签或路径… / Search tags or paths…\n已选 {0} 项 / {0} tags selected\n确认选择 / Confirm selection\n清空 / Clear · 取消 / Cancel\n确认添加 / Confirm addition",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Fyrz1",
              "name": "本地化实现约束",
              "fill": "$body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "实现时所有界面文字写入共享 Strings.resx 与 Strings.zh-Hans.resx；完整句子使用编号占位符。跟随 Windows 或手动语言，缺失项回退英文；用户标签名称与路径保留原文。",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
