              "content": "写入前在同一节点的短事务中 WATCH → 重读并比较编辑基线 → EXEC；不能在漫长 UI 编辑期间保持 WATCH。基线不符、类型变化、失效、驱逐都停止并保留草稿。无可靠保护能力时只读，不提供盲目覆盖。",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "kqhr2",
          "name": "按类型写入",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 4,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "kdrIs",
              "name": "按类型写入标题",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "按类型写入",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "UeOOP",
              "name": "按类型写入说明",
              "fill": "$muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "String 比较完整原始字节。Hash 仅比较与提交目标字段；Set / ZSet 保护目标成员状态。List 需完整有界快照，避免索引漂移；大列表只读或进入有界加载流程。Stream 已有记录不可编辑。",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
