          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1780,
          "content": "Instance Wizard → Wizard Body → Wizard Navigation + Protocol content slot\nInstance Wizard → Wizard Actions\nApp Shell → 原有标题栏 / 实例侧栏 / 文档页签 / Content slot\n\n允许覆盖：文案、图标、步骤状态、按钮可用状态和协议正文。\n禁止：在每张状态稿整块替换导航、操作栏、侧栏和页签。\n\nWPF 对应：InstanceWizard / WorkspaceView / 协议模块 Content。",
          "lineHeight": 1.7,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
